{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202170","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1120217001:1":{"text":"アルサ……オレの父親は父ちゃんだけだ。それに、オレはブラックロアーと関係ない。　　","source_cn":"阿尔萨……我的父亲只有老爹一个人，黑嚎也并非我的氏族。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x016A3D0F048EEF56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120217002:1":{"text":"オレはウール族のソーンだよ。過去も、今も、これからも。","source_cn":"我是乌尔氏族的索恩。过去是，现在是，以后也是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E933D7DB1C7E22C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120217003:1":{"text":"ずるいよ。本当なら黙ってた君を責めるつもりだったのにな。","source_cn":"好狡猾，我本来还要怪你不告诉我这件事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD3A54DF98E8A7A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120217004:1":{"text":"でも、可哀想だから許してあげる。","source_cn":"但，看你现在这么可怜，我原谅你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55376D14D510F6F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120217005:1":{"text":"アルサ、ごめん。大事なことじゃないと思ってたし……言いづらかったんだ。","source_cn":"抱歉，阿尔萨，这件事我觉得不重要……也很难开口讲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12E7ADCEA6ACD73A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120217006:1":{"text":"いいんだよ。君がウール族に入る前のことなんだから、言いたくなくて当然さ。","source_cn":"没关系啦。这都是你加入乌尔氏族之前的事了，不想说也正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE29D1B9480468F8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120217007:1":{"text":"でも、僕も気になることがあるんだ。","source_cn":"不过，我也有在意的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F054AE2C4AAE1C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120217008:1":{"text":"ソーン、戦歌祭で僕たちが手を組んでオルグさんに勝った時、君は……","source_cn":"索恩，我们之前在战歌节上联手打败奥格的时候，你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD6D2A381141249D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120217009:1":{"text":"あの時は何も考えてなかった。","source_cn":"那个时候，我什么都没想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12C307B4E9149A63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120217010:1":{"text":"ピンチだったからな。戦うこと以外に何かを考える余裕なんてなかった。","source_cn":"当时情况危急。除了战斗之外，我根本没有余裕思考任何东西了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55343CDD6DDC694D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120217011:1":{"text":"それに……オルグを倒したのは正しかった。そのことは変わらない。","source_cn":"更何况……打败奥格是正确的的事。这一点不会改变。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49837C00ED7243BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120217012:1":{"text":"オレ、オルグの葬式には参加したくない……オレのことはいいから、みんなで行ってきてくれ。","source_cn":"奥格的葬礼，我不想参加了……你们去吧，不用管我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB57C9303EE735D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120217013:1":{"text":"……ソーン、君の決定に口を挟みたくないけど、でも、後悔はしてほしくないの。","source_cn":"……我不想劝你如何决定，但索恩，我希望你不要留有遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x540826E1417D0E81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120217014:1":{"text":"複雑な気持ちなのは分かってる。でも大丈夫、ゆっくり考えればいい。","source_cn":"我知道你现在内心一定也很复杂。不过没关系，有些事情慢慢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9ADAB4A54069818C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120217015:1":{"text":"僕がそばにいるよ。それに、ウールのみんなもね。","source_cn":"我会陪着你的。还有乌尔的大家也会一直你身边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9BC463E7DB93320","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120217016:1":{"text":"君はもう二度と砂漠で独りぼっちだったあの赤ちゃんになったりしないよ。僕たちがいるから。","source_cn":"你永远不会再变成那个沙漠中孤立无援的婴儿，你还有我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28A3BEC053C17285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120217017:1":{"text":"……ありがとう、アルサ。","source_cn":"……谢谢你，阿尔萨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x383DA82B51474866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120217018:1":{"text":"どうやら、仲間の支えによって自らの傷を癒した若者がいるようだな。","source_cn":"看来，有一位年轻人已经在同伴的帮助下舔舐好自己的伤口了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5995F651EAFA4182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1120217018":{"text":"どうやら、仲間の支えによって自らの傷を癒した若者がいるようだな。","source_cn":"看来，有一位年轻人已经在同伴的帮助下舔舐好自己的伤口了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5995F651EAFA4182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1120217019:1":{"text":"うん、すぐ戻るよ……","source_cn":"嗯，我们马上回去——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88687148C6E9E59A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120217020:1":{"text":"ここを去るにしても、胸を張って行こう！","source_cn":"就算是离开这里，也会堂堂正正地走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F125315A5B2BD56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":""